@host = https://localhost:7034

### Confirm availability
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Read a bounded operational snapshot
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Create a manual temperature sensor
POST {{host}}/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"DEMO-TEMP-01","name":"Demo canopy sensor","locationId":"zone-a","category":"Environmental","intervalSeconds":3}

### Send a typed reading; update timestamp to now and increase sequence on subsequent requests
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry/float
Content-Type: application/json

{"batches":[[{"sensorId":"DEMO-TEMP-01","timestamp":"{{$datetime iso8601}}","sequence":1,"value":24.5}]]}

### Demonstrate overloaded power arithmetic
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry/power-comparison
Content-Type: application/json

{"leftSensorId":"SX-0002","rightSensorId":"SX-0005"}

### Inspect recursive deployment input
GET {{host}}/api/deployment
